#: lockeng.cc:914
msgid ""
"<h1>Screen Locking Failed!</h1>Your screen was not locked because the "
"<i>kcheckpass</i> program was not able to check your password. This is "
"usually the result of kcheckpass not being installed correctly. If you "
"installed KDE yourself, reinstall kcheckpass as root. If you are using a pre-"
"compiled package, contact the packager."
msgstr ""
"<h1>Kho^ng khoa' ddu+o+.c ma`n hi`nh </h1>Ma`n hi`nh cu?a ba.n kho^ng"
"bi. khoa' vi` chu+o+ng tri`nh <i>kcheckpass</i> kho^ng the^? kie^?m tra ma^.t kha^?u cu?a ba.n ."
"Nguye^n nha^n thu+o+`ng la` do kcheckpass kho^ng ddu+o+.c ca`i dda(.t ddu'ng ."
"Ne^'u ba.n tu+. ca`i dda(.t KDE, ha~y ca`i la.i kcheckpass ba(`ng root . Ne^'u ba.n du`ng"
"go'i dda~ bie^n di.ch, ha~y lie^n he^. ngu+o+`i la`m go'i ddo' ."

